	(text "=== MR1 PERISTALTIC PUMP & USB-PD HUB ARCHITECTURE ===\n1. Dual USB-C Receptacles aligned to Housing_Pump_Case back-wall cutouts (X = +/-15 mm)\n2. STUSB4500 USB-PD Sink negotiates high-power <= 9V VBUS for peristaltic pump motors\n3. High-efficiency synchronous buck converter outputs clean +5V power to MR1 Nanopore Reader\n4. TI TS3USB221 USB 2.0 switch passes 100 kHz streaming data straight through to Host laptop\n5. USB-C SBU1/SBU2 lines provide bidirectional I2C control link with auto-polarity detection\n6. Dual Honeywell TruStability / ABP2 microfluidic pressure transducers monitor Cis and Trans lines\n7. Hardware emergency cutoff gate immediately shuts down pumps upon leak detection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 180 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cc000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001")
	)
